he huge and well-organized materials are made possible by frame- works with hypertext links.\",\"reference_url\":\"files/DpZGXdhaTxtaR67JyAHgDVkSP3Fo4nvV4FYCWNadE2Ln/ontologies.pdf#page=8\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1760528238,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"4f3d3b3b-070a-452c-b89b-0280efa3d95b\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"index\":0}],\"created\":1760528238,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
